  "body": "Terminal evidence requested metric names that the exporter never registers, so Go and Channel counter captures were empty during a failed RC. Select the actual Go and Channel names and include the standard process collector alongside the existing host process collector, preserving all eight query partitions and existing capture budgets.\n\nValidation: tests-first static and real collector fixture RED/GREEN; 23 methods and 80 fixture cases pass. Independent Standards and Spec reviews found no issues. Linux CI is pending.\n\nThis improves diagnostic coverage; it does not change delivery behavior or establish a root cause for the failed message-loss sample. The original RC failure and exact Lease zero-inventory evidence remain preserved in the readiness report.\n",
